#### Story C — Persistent agent sessions (`agent.db` + DatabaseSessionService)

**Goal:** Agent sessions and ADK state survive backend restart; FE loads session list and message history from server instead of memory-only context.

**Database layout:**

```text
tagphy.db   → catalog, settings, failure_log (unchanged; SQLiteConnection)
agent.db    → all agent-related storage (new file beside app on USB)
```

- **Do not** merge ADK DDL into TagPhy SQL migrations — ADK creates its own tables via SQLAlchemy (`sessions`, `events`, `app_states`, `user_states`, `adk_internal_metadata`).
- Optional **app-owned** tables in `agent.db` (same file, your migrations): e.g. `agent_conversations`, `agent_messages` for UI-friendly sidebar/history — if ADK `events` JSON is too heavy to render directly.

**Backend:**

- Add dependency: `google-adk[db]` (SQLAlchemy + async SQLite driver).
- Replace `InMemorySessionService` in `AgentManager` with `DatabaseSessionService(db_url="sqlite+aiosqlite:///…/agent.db")`.
- Keep `AgentManager` rate limits / request cap in process memory or move to `agent.db` metadata — document choice.
- **New API (for FE persistence):**
  - `GET /api/agent/sessions` — list conversations (id, title, agent_type, updated_at).
  - `GET /api/agent/sessions/{session_id}/messages` — ordered messages for chat replay.
  - Existing `POST /api/agent/photo-finder` unchanged; ensure it appends to durable store when UI tables exist.
- Photo Finder **tools** still read **`tagphy.db`** (catalog) — only session/chat uses **`agent.db`**.

**Frontend:**

- Remove or slim `AgentSessionContext` in-memory session list; fetch sessions on Agent page mount.
- On `/agent/:sessionId`, load messages from API; send still via `POST /api/agent/photo-finder`.
- Refresh browser restores sidebar + history when backend session exists.

**Out of scope:** Mid-chat model switch, multi-agent routes, cross-device sync, storing full JPEGs in agent DB.

**Acceptance:**

- [ ] Restart FastAPI — prior agent session can still receive messages with same `session_id` (ADK layer).
- [ ] Refresh browser — sidebar and chat history restored from API (app layer).
- [ ] `tagphy.db` tables unchanged; `agent.db` created automatically on first agent use.
- [ ] Catalog scan/library unaffected.

**Dependencies:** Stories A–B independent of C. C can ship without picture detail links from agent thumbnails.

