### Agent platform notes (carry forward)

- **Model settings** (global default + per-agent override in `tagphy.db` settings) — planned; not part of A–C; do before Concierge or second agent.
- **Do not** rewrite catalog `SQLiteConnection` to SQLAlchemy; ADK SQLAlchemy is **agent.db only**.
- Chat transcript in UI is **not** catalog memory; catalog stays in `tagphy.db`.

## Explicitly out of scope (for now)

Not Trello stories until you reopen them (agent-track items above are **in** scope via Stage Seven):

- Multi-thread / multi-process scan workers
- Desktop packaging (Mac/Windows, single entrypoint)
- Naming-collision / deep error-handling epics beyond what exists
- Local VLM tagging; generic “tag count cap” product stories
- PII / ID-document visual or OCR gates
- Stage Five UI polish follow-ups

